OL,3,GNEWSARight-wing commentator Milo
OL,4,AYiannopoulos detained by ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish right-wing political
OL,7,Fcommentator Milo Yiannopoulos has been
OL,8,Fdetained by Immigration and Customs
OL,9,FEnforcement (ICE) and is awaiting
OL,10,Fdeportation.
OL,12,FYiannopoulos, 41, a former editor of
OL,13,FBreitbart News and onetime political
OL,14,Faide to rapper Kanye West, appears to
OL,15,Fbe held in Louisiana, according to
OL,16,FICE's inmate registry.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
