OL,3,GNEWSARight-wing commentator Milo
OL,4,AYiannopoulos detained by ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,7,F(DHS) said he "was issued a final order
OL,8,Fof removal by an Immigration Judge on
OL,9,FJuly 22, after failing to show up for
OL,10,Fhis immigration hearing", and will
OL,11,Fremain in custody pending deportation.
OL,13,FThe self-styled provocateur has called
OL,14,Fhimself the "most fabulous supervillain
OL,15,Fon the internet". His critics call him
OL,16,Fa purveyor of hate speech.
